\\text{d}x+(\\frac{∂f}{∂y})\\,\\text{d}y+(\\frac{∂f}{∂z})\\,\\text{d}z \\\\  & =(2xy-{z}^{2})\\,\\text{d}x+({x}^{2}+3{y}^{2}z)\\,\\text{d}y+({y}^{3}-2xz)\\,\\text{d}z\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534983 17592186045417 true] [17592186446873 1068 #edb/ref 17592186446869 13194139534983 17592186045417 true] [17592186446873 1069 "q-79957" 13194139534983 17592186045417 true] [17592186446873 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534983 17592186045417 true] [17592186446873 1071 "Find the differential $\\text{d}f$ for the function $f(x,y,z)=\\operatorname{ln}⁡(xyz).$" 13194139534983 17592186045417 true] [17592186446873 1072 #uuid "26a471f3-9b78-5070-a5db-c0478cd96f7d" 13194139534983 17592186045417 true] [17592186446873 1074 "We compute the differential using the formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{d}f(x,y,z) & =(\\frac{∂f}{∂x})\\,\\text{d}x+(\\frac{∂f}{∂y})\\,\\text{d}y+(\\frac{∂f}{∂z})\\,\\text{d}z \\\\  & =\\frac{yz\\,\\text{d}x}{xyz}+\\frac{xz\\,\\text{d}y}{xyz}+\\frac{xy\\,\\text{d}z}{xyz} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\,\\text{d}x}{x}+\\frac{\\,\\text{d}y}{y}+\\frac{\\,\\text{d}z}{z}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534983 17592186045417 true] [17592186446874 1068 #edb/ref 17592186446871 13194139534983 17592186045417 true] [17592186446874 1069 "q-79748" 13194139534983 17592186045417 true] [17592186446874 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534983 17592186045417 true] [17592186446874 1071 "Given a rectangular solid, find the differential $\\text{d}S$ for the surface area $S$ of the rectangular solid if the lengths of the sides are $a=4,$ $b=5,$ and $c=7.$" 13194139534983 17592186045417 true] [17592186446874 1072 #uuid "4e75bdad-f36e-527c-a1e9-527d230dfe09" 13194139534983 17592186045417 true] [17592186446874 1074 "The  surface area of the rectangular solid is $S=2ab+2bc+2ac.$ Let's find the differential:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{d}S(a,b,c) & =(\\frac{∂S}{∂a})\\,\\text{d}a+(\\frac{∂S}{∂b})\\,\\text{d}b+(\\frac{∂S}{∂c})\\,\\text{d}c \\\\  & =2(b+c)\\,\\text{d}a+2(a+c)\\,\\text{d}b+2(a+b)\\,\\text{d}c\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor $a=4,$ $b=5,$ and $c=7,$ the differential is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{d}S(4,5,7) & =2(5+7)\\,\\text{d}a+2(4+7)\\,\\text{d}b+2(4+5)\\,\\text{d}c \\\\  & =24\\,\\text{d}a+22\\,\\text{d}b+18\\,\\text{d}c.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534983 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"answer-0ac0761e-892b-53e0-bd4a-bcb35229b775" 17592186446854 "answer-15f3dee8-e6f4-5787-8395-50cb7a5ce3d9" 17592186446855 "answer-1cbc47ca-c217-5961-8ebc-60818e4b7533" 17592186446856 "answer-418af1c1-d6d4-51bf-ada3-9317c8a8af10" 17592186446857 "answer-592edaac-aa03-5270-a8be-982b5b3cf8eb" 17592186446858 "answer-72ff75da-b13e-5583-ae20-2ce0e2a55a49" 17592186446859 "answer-81e483ab-3798-55cc-8300-27c841a9bb82" 17592186446860 "answer-8596556d-0399-5275-8336-5e8a62170257" 17592186446861 "answer-949f1307-08bf-5cc4-b984-37982aadf2e7" 17592186446862 "answer-9ca16da6-7a8f-5ec5-ade1-d109e6b3501f" 17592186446863 "answer-a1659264-c9c8-589f-9fdb-0ef010eb62c1" 17592186446864 "answer-e1d94390-787f-5fc0-9917-5d0f985a5aff" 17592186446865 "answer-eaf3116a-63b5-5ad8-b1f5-843a36b5e2c3" 17592186446866 "answer-f3201288-0ff0-5d05-8546-c32107c2bd04" 17592186446867 "answer-f807cb6c-01c1-5522-a5dd-56315c935102" 17592186446868 "answer-field-102010b9-db98-5ea2-8e9e-7da7428fc2a9" 17592186446869 "answer-field-6982bff1-d527-5b1b-a1cc-95bd4bd0cec5" 17592186446870 "answer-field-91bbad55-b7c9-5018-bd2b-a6b22c055c21" 17592186446871 "question-1e237109-086a-53bd-a512-ebeaca53c3dd" 17592186446872 "question-26a471f3-9b78-5070-a5db-c0478cd96f7d" 17592186446873 "question-4e75bdad-f36e-527c-a1e9-527d230dfe09" 17592186446874} :edb/committed false :edb/speculative true}
